{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "organ-wah",
  "name": "Funky Organ + Wah",
  "description": "Hammond B3 through auto-wah and Leslie for funky organ tones.",
  "graph": {
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": "ctrl-1",
        "type": "control",
        "name": "Keyboard",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 2 },
        "params": {
          "cv": 0, "cvMode": "unipolar", "velocity": 1,
          "midiVelocity": true, "gate": 0, "glide": 0.01, "voices": 8
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "organ-1",
        "type": "pipe-organ",
        "name": "Hammond B3",
        "position": { "x": 3, "y": 2 },
        "params": {
          "frequency": 220,
          "drawbar16": 0.7, "drawbar8": 1.0, "drawbar4": 0.8,
          "drawbar223": 0.4, "drawbar2": 0.6, "drawbar135": 0.2,
          "drawbar113": 0.15, "drawbar1": 0.1,
          "voicing": 0, "chiff": 0.2,
          "percussion": 1, "percHarmonic": 0, "percDecay": 0, "percVolume": 0.7,
          "chorusVibrato": 4,
          "tremulant": 0.0, "tremRate": 6, "wind": 0.04, "brightness": 0.8
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "adsr-1",
        "type": "adsr",
        "name": "ADSR",
        "position": { "x": 6, "y": 4 },
        "params": { "attack": 0.005, "decay": 0.08, "sustain": 0.92, "release": 0.12 }
      },
      {
        "id": "vca-1",
        "type": "gain",
        "name": "VCA",
        "position": { "x": 6, "y": 2 },
        "params": { "gain": 0.8 }
      },
      {
        "id": "wah-1",
        "type": "wah",
        "name": "Auto-Wah",
        "position": { "x": 8, "y": 2 },
        "params": {
          "mode": 0, "freq": 600, "range": 0.8,
          "resonance": 0.6, "speed": 3.0, "sensitivity": 0.8, "mix": 0.85
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "les-1",
        "type": "leslie",
        "name": "Leslie 122",
        "position": { "x": 10, "y": 2 },
        "params": {
          "speed": 1, "brake": 0, "drive": 0.2,
          "depth": 0.7, "hornDrum": 0.5, "micDist": 0.15, "ramp": 0.5, "mix": 1.0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "reverb-1",
        "type": "reverb",
        "name": "Room",
        "position": { "x": 12, "y": 2 },
        "params": { "time": 0.6, "damp": 0.5, "preDelay": 12, "mix": 0.18 }
      },
      {
        "id": "out-1",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Main Out",
        "position": { "x": 14, "y": 2 },
        "params": { "level": 1 }
      },
      {
        "id": "notes-1",
        "type": "notes",
        "name": "Info",
        "position": { "x": 10, "y": 5 },
        "params": {
          "text": "FUNKY ORGAN + WAH\n\nHammond B3 with auto-wah envelope\nfollower for funky organ tones.\n\nSignal:\nKeyboard -> Organ -> VCA -> Wah -> Leslie -> Reverb -> Out\n\nWah settings:\n- ENV mode = follows your playing dynamics\n- Try switching to LFO mode for periodic sweep\n- Range = how far the filter sweeps\n- Reso = filter sharpness/quack\n\nTips:\n- Play staccato for maximum wah effect\n- Increase Sensitivity for more responsive wah\n- Toggle Leslie SLOW/FAST!\n- Switch Wah to LFO mode + Speed 4Hz for tremolo-wah"
        }
      }
    ],
    "connections": [
      { "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "cv-out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "organ-1", "portId": "pitch" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "organ-1", "portId": "gate" }, "kind": "gate" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "gate" }, "kind": "gate" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "organ-1", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "vca-1", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "env" }, "to": { "moduleId": "vca-1", "portId": "cv" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "vca-1", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "wah-1", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "wah-1", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "les-1", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "les-1", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "out-1", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" }
    ]
  }
}
